# Keeps the Fly build context small and stops host-built artifacts (or a real
# .env) from leaking into the image. Secrets reach the worker via `fly secrets`.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
.turbo
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The worker needs no web/ui SOURCE, but their package.json files must stay in
# the context: pnpm-workspace.yaml globs packages/*, and `pnpm install
# --frozen-lockfile` fails if a package the lockfile knows about is missing.
packages/web
!packages/web/package.json
packages/ui
!packages/ui/package.json
specs
docs
.playwright-mcp
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/coverage
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
